  "hindi": "मैं मनु हुआ और सूर्य; मैं ऋषि कक्षीवान् हूँ, विप्र हूँ। मैंने अर्जुनी के पुत्र कुत्स को वश में किया; मैं कवि उशना हूँ; मुझे देखो।",
  "english": "I was Manu and the sun; I am the sage Kakṣīvān, an inspired one. I subdued Kutsa, son of Arjunī; I am the seer Uśanā; behold me.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "ni ṛñje: 'subdued' is a tentative sense of ni-√ṛñj (literally 'stretch/direct down'). ārjuneya is taken as a patronymic ('son of Arjunī'). The speaker is not named in the verse itself; the first person is rendered as given.",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
