  "hindi": "मैंने आर्य को भूमि दी, यजन करने वाले मनुष्य को वर्षा; मैं गर्जती हुई जलराशियों को ले आया; मेरे अभिप्राय के पीछे देव चले।",
  "english": "I gave the earth to the Ārya, rain to the mortal who worships; I led the roaring waters; the gods followed my purpose.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "ketam is rendered 'purpose' (ketu: banner, sign, intention); anu ... āyan 'followed' is read as anu √i. dāśuṣe: dative of the perfect participle of √dāś, 'who worships/offers'.",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
